  "unitId": "phase2_unit7",
  "title": "Time Prepositions",
  "description": "on / in / at / since / for / ago / before / by",
  "level": "A2",
  "explain": {
    "ta": "காலத்தை குறிப்பிட நாம் பல்வேறு prepositions பயன்படுத்துகிறோம். 'on' என்பது நாட்களுக்கு (on Monday, on 5th June), 'in' என்பது மாதங்கள், வருடங்கள் மற்றும் நாளின் பகுதிகளுக்கு (in July, in 2020, in the morning), 'at' என்பது குறிப்பிட்ட நேரத்திற்கு (at 5 pm, at night) பயன்படுத்தப்படுகிறது. 'since' ஒரு தொடக்க புள்ளியைக் காட்டுகிறது (since 2020), 'for' கால அளவைக் காட்டுகிறது (for 2 years), 'ago' கடந்த காலத்தைக் குறிக்கிறது (2 years ago), 'before' முன்பு என்று பொருள் (before 5 pm), 'by' என்பது ஒரு குறிப்பிட்ட நேரத்திற்குள் என்று பொருள் (by 5 pm).",
    "en": "We use different prepositions to indicate time. 'on' is used for days and dates (on Monday, on 5th June), 'in' for months, years, and parts of the day (in July, in 2020, in the morning), 'at' for specific times (at 5 pm, at night). 'since' shows a starting point in time (since 2020), 'for' shows duration (for 2 years), 'ago' refers to past time (2 years ago), 'before' means earlier than (before 5 pm), and 'by' means not later than (by 5 pm).",
    "table": [
      {
        "key": "on",
        "examples": ["on Monday", "on 5th June", "on Christmas Day"]
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "examples": ["in July", "in 2020", "in the morning"]
      },
      {
        "key": "at",
        "examples": ["at 5 pm", "at night", "at noon"]
      },
      {
        "key": "since",
        "examples": ["since 2020", "since Monday", "since morning"]
      },
      {
        "key": "for",
        "examples": ["for 2 years", "for 3 hours", "for a week"]
      },
      {
        "key": "ago",
        "examples": ["2 years ago", "3 days ago", "an hour ago"]
      },
      {
        "key": "before",
        "examples": ["before 5 pm", "before Monday", "before noon"]
      },
      {
        "key": "by",
        "examples": ["by 5 pm", "by Monday", "by tomorrow"]
      }
    ]
  },
